viations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.91/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"a6494c122f00f38017f0ecf1950c874f4f4ae57e08846d58be582b60bd2a43b9"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.91/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"60426346c22f0f7cdb539c808659bd9209cd8e5411c0b8aa5dfa6adf10365154"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.91/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"8ac2bb7e6caadc041163b5746a8d0e9389b4e359d94654dbec00cf74f63c51e3"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"114.0.5735.91"}